  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through PEACE &amp; JUSTICE in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEACE &amp; JUSTICE will strengthen the coping mechanism of marginalised youth (aged 15-35) in South Sudan through provision of psychosocial support and trainings in policy advocacy. Using the acquired knowledge &amp; skills, youth will participate in the formulation and implementation of policies. Emphasis will be put on policies and resolutions such as South Sudan&#x2019;s National Women Strategy &amp; UNSCR 1325 focus on how the conflict affect women and propose relevant interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
